/** @defgroup lexleo_vm_borrowers_api lexleo_vm borrowers API
 *  @ingroup lexleo_vm_api
 *
 *  @brief Borrower-facing API for the `lexleo_vm` module.
 *
 *  @details
 *  This group contains the runtime API exposed to code that receives and uses
 *  an already created LexLeo VM handle.
 *
 *  Borrower-facing functions do not create or destroy the VM handle. They
 *  operate on a handle whose ownership remains with the caller.
 */
